## Boss fight
megacreepers.boss.title=§2§lMega Creeper
megacreepers.boss.subtitle=§aIt does not die when it explodes...
megacreepers.boss.awakens=The Mega Creeper awakens! Its hide shrugs off hits until it has to recharge. The vault stays sealed until it falls.
megacreepers.boss.recharging=§eThe Mega Creeper is recharging - hit it now!
megacreepers.boss.charging=§dThe Mega Creeper is charging fireworks - watch for the red rings!
megacreepers.boss.armored=§7Its hide shrugs off the hit. Wait for it to recharge.
